<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Storage Tech EPS view cut.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Storage Tech EPS view cut.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- SoundView Financial said analyst Gary Helmig lowered his earnings estimates on Storage Technology Corp for fiscal years 1997 and 1998.</p>
<p>-- Action follows by one day Storage Tech's release of fiscal first quarter earnings.</p>
<p>-- Cut 1997 estimate to $3.63 per share from $3.72.</p>
<p>-- Cut 1998 estimate to $4.10 per share from $4.18.</p>
<p>-- Kept ratings at short-term buy and long-term hold.</p>
<p>-- Shares fell four to 34-3/4.</p>
<p>((-- Wall Street desk, 212-859-1730))</p>
</text>
